{"id": "19-2002-2-9", "zh": "5,137. 在 kya 前，除 ñā 等以外的 ā 变为 ī", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2003-2-10", "zh": "在 kya 前，除 ñā 等以外、以 ā 结尾的动词词根，其 ā 变为 ī。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2003-11-14", "zh": "如 upaṭhīyati、upaṭhīyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2003-15-29", "zh": "ṭhā 替换为 ṭhaha 时，依“kyassā”一条加 īña，因此得 patiṭṭhahīyati、patiṭṭhahīyanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2003-30-34", "zh": "用于无人称被动（bhāva）时，ā 变为 ī，得 ṭhīyati、ṭhīyate。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2003-35-39", "zh": "同样，带前缀 pa 时得 patiṭṭhissati、patiṭṭhahissati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2003-40-49", "zh": "语尾 ī 变为 si 时，得 aṭṭhāsi、aṭṭhaṃsu、saṇṭhahi、saṇṭhahiṃsu。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2003-50-52", "zh": "patiṭṭhissa、patiṭṭhahissa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2003-53-63", "zh": "tiṭṭhe、tiṭṭheyya，saṇṭhe、saṇṭheyya、saṇṭheyyuṃ，saṇṭhahe、saṇṭhaheyya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2003-64-69", "zh": "tiṭṭhatu、ṭhātu、saṇṭhahatu 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2004-2-8", "zh": "pā 词根，义为“饮”；替换为 piva 时得 pivati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2004-9-26", "zh": "在“tavaggavaraṇā”等规则中，依把“bayañā”拆成独立规则的做法，v 变为 b，得 pibati。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-2004-27-31", "zh": "用于被动时，得 pīyati、pīyanti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2005-2-5", "zh": "as 词根，义为“存在”，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2006-2-5", "zh": "52. t 变为 th", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2007-2-7", "zh": "在 atthi 的词根 as 之后，t 变为 th。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2007-8-12", "zh": "经后音同化，再变为本组首字母 t，得 atthi。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2007-13-33", "zh": "依“在 nta、māna、anti、yi、yuṃ 等之前首音脱落”一条，a 脱落，得 santi。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2008-2-6", "zh": "53. 在 si、hi 前变为 aṭa", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2009-2-6", "zh": "在 si、hi 前，as 变为 aṭa。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2009-7-9", "zh": "ṭ 表示整体替换。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2009-10-12", "zh": "如 tvaṃ asi（你是）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2009-13-18", "zh": "作了后音同化等处理后，得 idāni tumhe attha（现在你们是）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2010-2-7", "zh": "54. mi、ma 可选地变为 mhi、mha，并且……", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2011-2-12", "zh": "在 as 之后的 mi、ma 可选地变为 mhi、mha，同时 as 变为 aṭa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2011-13-14", "zh": "如 amhi（我是）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2012-2-5", "zh": "55. 在这些之前变为 s", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2013-2-10", "zh": "在这些 mi、ma 之前，as 变为 s，目的是阻止后音同化。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2013-11-15", "zh": "如 asmi，amha、asma。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2013-16-17", "zh": "在将来时词缀前——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2014-2-10", "zh": "5,129. 在 a、ā、ssa 等之前", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2015-2-12", "zh": "在完成时（parokkhā）的 a 等、非今过去时（anajjatana）的 ā 等、条件式（kriyātipatti）的 ssā 等以及将来时的 ssati 等语尾之前，as 变为 bhū。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2015-13-23", "zh": "规定这一替换，是为了表明在某些特定词缀前不用 as，所以不会出现 asitabba 之类的形式。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2015-24-27", "zh": "如 bhavissati、bhavissanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2015-28-31", "zh": "abhavā、abhavu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2015-32-38", "zh": "在条件式中替换为 bhū，得 abhavissa、abhavissaṃsu 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2015-39-40", "zh": "在 eyya 等语尾前——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2016-2-17", "zh": "50. 在 atthi 之后，eyya 等六个语尾依次变为 sa、su、sa、satha、saṃ、sāma", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2017-2-12", "zh": "在 as（义为“存在”）之后，eyya 等六个语尾依次变为 sa 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2017-13-19", "zh": "经后音同化，得 so assa（他可能是）、te assu（他们可能是）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2017-20-25", "zh": "tvaṃ assa、tumhe assatha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2017-26-31", "zh": "ahaṃ assaṃ、mayaṃ assāma。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2017-32-46", "zh": "在 tu 等语尾前得 so atu；a 脱落时得 santhu；替换为 a 时得 tvaṃ ahi、tumhe attha。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-2017-47-54", "zh": "amhi、amha；替换为 s 时得 asmi、asma。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2017-55-64", "zh": "由于“多样”（bahula）一条的统摄，不定过去时中也有 āsi、āsiṃsu、āsuṃ 等形式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2018-2-5", "zh": "brū 词根，义为“说”，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2019-2-5", "zh": "36. brū 之后的 ti 加 īña", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2020-2-8", "zh": "在 brū 之后，ti 可选地加 īña。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2020-9-13", "zh": "经元音增强、替换为 av，标记字母脱落后，得 bravīti。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-2021-2-7", "zh": "5,97. brū 不变为 o", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2022-2-8", "zh": "在辅音前，brū 的元音不变为 o。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2022-9-10", "zh": "如 brūti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2022-11-13", "zh": "替换为 uva 时，得 brūvanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2023-2-9", "zh": "20. ti、anti 变为 ṭa、ṭū", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2024-2-11", "zh": "在 āha **之后的** ti、anti 变为 ṭa、ṭū。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2024-12-14", "zh": "ṭ 表示整体替换。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2024-15-23", "zh": "正因为规定了 āha 之后的 ti、anti 变为 ṭa、ṭū，由此可知：在 ti、anti 前，brū 变为 āha。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2024-24-27", "zh": "如 āha、āhu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2024-28-31", "zh": "brūsi、brūtha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2024-32-36", "zh": "brūmi、brūma 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2024-37-38", "zh": "bravissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2024-39-43", "zh": "abravi、abravī、abravuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2024-44-48", "zh": "在非今过去时中得 abravā、abravu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2024-49-50", "zh": "在完成时中——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2025-2-7", "zh": "16. 在 a 等语尾前，brū 变为 āha", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2026-2-6", "zh": "在完成时的 a 等语尾前，brū 变为 āha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2026-7-15", "zh": "如“据说他在梦中说了”（supine kira so āha）、te āhu 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2026-16-17", "zh": "abravissa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2026-18-20", "zh": "brave、braveyya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2026-21-26", "zh": "不作元音增强时得 brūtu，另有 bravantu 等。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-2027-2-11", "zh": "han 词根，义为“伤害”；在 ti 前得 so hanati，中间词缀脱落时得 hanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2027-12-15", "zh": "te hananti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2027-16-26", "zh": "用于被动时，在 ya 前 n 经前音同化变为 ññ，因此得 haññati、haññanti、haññare。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2027-27-30", "zh": "同样，有 hanissati 等。", "confidence": 85}
